{
  "format": "tynt",
  "version": 1,
  "title": "starter",
  "source": "let x = 76;\nlet y = 61;\nlet shade = 3;\nlet score = 0;\n\nexport function init(): void {\n  clear(0);\n}\n\nexport function update(): void {\n  if (button(\"left\")) x = clamp(x - 1, 0, 152);\n  if (button(\"right\")) x = clamp(x + 1, 0, 152);\n  if (button(\"up\")) y = clamp(y - 1, 0, 136);\n  if (button(\"down\")) y = clamp(y + 1, 0, 136);\n  if (buttonPressed(\"a\")) shade = wrap(shade + 1, 1, 4);\n  if (buttonReleased(\"a\")) score++;\n  if (buttonPressed(\"b\")) {\n    x = 76;\n    y = 61;\n    shade = 3;\n    score = 0;\n  }\n}\n\nexport function draw(): void {\n  clear(0);\n  triangle(x + 2, y - 4, x + 6, y - 4, x + 4, y - 1, shade, true);\n  rect(x, y, 8, 8, shade, true);\n  text(\"tynt\", 72, 77, 2);\n  text(\"SCORE \" + score, 8, 10, 2);\n}\n",
  "author": "tynt",
  "description": "Start with movement, actions, reset, and a simple score.",
  "controls": "Arrows move · A changes shade · B resets",
  "canvas": {
    "width": 160,
    "height": 144
  },
  "palette": {
    "model": "indexed",
    "colors": [
      "#000000",
      "#555555",
      "#aaaaaa",
      "#ffffff"
    ]
  }
}
